B.byT=s(["The fetus is now considered to be late preterm.","The average 34-week fetus is 17.8 inches (45.2 cm) long and weighs 5.2 pounds (2377 grams).","The average 35-week fetus is 18.2 inches (46.3 cm) long and weighs 5.7 pounds (2595 grams).","The proximal tibial epiphysis ossification center may be seen in about 35% of fetuses at 35 weeks.","The average 36-week fetus is 18.6 inches (47.3 cm) long and weighs 6.2 pounds (2813 grams)."],t.s)
